  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "NYALES WEB-012 implemented customer API",
    "version": "0.12.1",
    "description": "Local implementation slice; not the full future product API. All mutations require Management/NSM. Domain authorization and device session binding remain mandatory. Merge/alias review is now implemented in operations-api.web013-014.openapi.json. Assignment/transfer remains WEB-015. No routing/geocoding or contact automation. Read models permit projected additive fields; no raw contact phone is returned outside Management/NSM. Customer is the primary entity (one site); account business layer removed in migration 0017. Legacy snapshot audits remain historical only."
  },
